               loading=&#34;lazy&#34; data-zoomable /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
  &lt;/div&gt;&lt;/figure&gt;

&lt;em&gt;A 3D vision-guided robotic sorting workflow: image acquisition, instance segmentation, point-cloud generation, grasp-pose computation, eye-to-hand calibration, and robotic sorting.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&#34;my-role&#34;&gt;My role&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;I lead the industrial 3D algorithm work behind this platform, covering reconstruction, calibration, depth/point-cloud/mesh processing, measurement, defect inspection, registration, 6D pose estimation, and robot-guidance workflows that can be deployed through Smart3.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&#34;3d-imaging&#34;&gt;3D imaging&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The imaging layer turns raw optical observations into usable depth, height, range, and point-cloud data. It includes laser-profile extraction, structured-light reconstruction, RGB-D alignment, phase processing, depth-map generation, and point-cloud color mapping.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;















