  &lt;/div&gt;&lt;/figure&gt;

&lt;em&gt;Segmentation-driven mesh denoising preserves feature regions while suppressing noise.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&#34;detection-and-inspection&#34;&gt;Detection and inspection&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Inspection algorithms use 3D geometry together with intensity or RGB cues to detect missed welds, broken welds, pinholes, blowholes, dents, scratches, bumps, glue defects, foreign objects, and surface deviations. The same stack can feed rule-based 3D thresholds or AI-assisted segmentation depending on the application.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;















