               loading=&#34;lazy&#34; data-zoomable /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
  &lt;/div&gt;&lt;/figure&gt;

&lt;em&gt;3D defect inspection for lithium-battery welds and other reflective industrial surfaces.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&#34;measurement&#34;&gt;Measurement&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The measurement layer turns point clouds and range images into production values: gap width, step height, flatness, parallelism, volume, profile deviation, reference-plane distance, and GD&amp;amp;T-style evaluations. It is designed to keep geometric measurement and inspection decisions in the same coordinate frame.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;















&lt;figure  &gt;
  &lt;div class=&#34;flex justify-center	&#34;&gt;
