  &lt;/div&gt;&lt;/figure&gt;

&lt;em&gt;Point-cloud cleaning, module segmentation, convex-hull/reference-plane construction, and side-view measurement.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&#34;matching-and-pose&#34;&gt;Matching and pose&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The matching layer supports CAD-assisted matching, point-cloud stitching, IVD/ICP matching, feature-based registration, and 6D pose estimation. In robot-facing workflows, viewpoint encoding and codebook search can turn a sparse observation into an object pose hypothesis for verification and grasp planning.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;















